Subject: [PATCH] fuse: guard cached replies and track shared mappings

Apply after share-profile, share-complete, share-wait, and share-dir-cache.
Default off: virtiofs.coherent_cache=1 enables recovery/race guards;
virtiofs.mmap_poll=1 selects stat polling, 2 selects content polling.
Requires virtiofsd patches 0017 and 0018.

--- a/fs/fuse/dir.c
+++ b/fs/fuse/dir.c
